### VS Code ###
# Ignore machine-specific VS Code state, but COMMIT the generic run configs (launch.json / tasks.json)
# so contributors get working Run/Debug + the prepare-args preLaunchTask out of the box.
.vscode/*
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/tasks.json

### Mac OS ###
.DS_Store

### Minecraft Modding ###
# Nothing produced by a dev-client/server run is tracked. Gallery screenshots for the listing
# automation are NOT taken from here: copy the shots you want into art/gallery/ (tracked) — see
# .github/workflows/modrinth-gallery.yml.
run/
!**/src/**/run/
**/src/generated/**/.cache/
repo/
!**/src/**/repo/
PROJECT_PLAN.md
/tools/__pycache__
# Stonecutter run directories (<loader>/versions/<mc>/runs/...) — never tracked.
runs/
# python caches (scripts)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# node deps (e.g. tools/gradle-mcp markdownlint)
node_modules/
/forge/versions
/neoforge/versions
/fabric/versions
